# ProfiARG Environment Variables (Optional)
# The application works 100% out-of-the-box using free OpenStreetMap tiles (no API key required).

# If you want to use custom tile providers or Google Maps in the future:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
# NEXT_PUBLIC_MAPTILER_API_KEY=your_maptiler_key_here
